# 🚀 Final Mental Model

```text
                         SOLID
                           │
          ┌────────────────┼────────────────┐
          ↓                ↓                ↓
     Maintainable       Flexible        Testable
          │                │                │
          └────────────────┼────────────────┘
                           ↓
                    Loose Coupling
                           ↓
                Dependency Inversion
                           ↓
                     Abstractions
                           ↓
                  Dependency Injection
                           ↓
                 ASP.NET Core DI
                           │
          ┌────────────────┼────────────────┐
          ↓                ↓                ↓
